    "truth": "A modern American adult college student awoke in Valerie's body shortly before the wizard abducted her. The wizard detected alien memories and intends to dissect the phenomenon through dangerous soul-binding rituals. She understands little of this world's magic and fears that the princess's original consciousness may also be trapped.",
