  },
  {
    "id": "reflection_decoy",
    "label": "The willing princess is a mirror-made impostor",
    "truth": "The wizard has locked the real Valerie inside a mirror prison and created a nearly perfect simulacrum that warmly claims to be his willing guest. The duplicate has convincing memories and can speak for itself, but it does not erase the original captive's danger. The dragon must identify the two without simply attacking everyone who resembles her.",
    "cue": "Two overlapping reflections briefly show different movements; a mirror's backing bears a concealed breathing hole.",
