    "truth": "Valerie carries a dangerous magical contagion the wizard secretly introduced during a royal feast. He kidnapped her under the pretext of quarantine and now demands the king surrender a sacred healing relic to secure its cure. He possesses the remedy but hides it behind warded laboratories; reckless release could spread the disease.",
    "cue": "Doctors' reports identify the first symptoms immediately after a dinner served by the wizard's own attendants.",
