  ward:'The Heartroot listens to tree-song; its ward is strong in the orchard but cannot project beyond the grove.',
  custody:'A living glasshouse holds the captive; its lock depends on a gardener chant and a feeding routine.',
  escape:'Thickets regrow behind pursuers; old irrigation trenches and beekeeper trails bypass much of the hedge.',
  flaw:'Ancient gardener marks identify invited guests; old pruning rites briefly redirect the Heartroot.',
  tell:'Different vines withdraw before gardeners while ignoring their steel tools.'},
 ash_mine:{
