  sky:'Smokestacks and rock roofs deny easy descent; exposed loading yards have swivel harpoons.',
  perimeter:'Ore bridges, furnace gates and a guarded hoist separate the surface from the excavation.',
  garrison:'Contract miners, slag golems, overseers and coolant technicians know different sections of the mine.',
  ward:'Runic heat exchangers power molten barriers. The barriers fail locally when coolant flow is interrupted.',
