  garrison:'Ice constructs, astronomers, observatory custodians and mercenary trackers use signal mirrors.',
  ward:'Three moving divination lenses predict likely approaches, but their angles are physical and finite.',
  custody:'A sealed meridian cell lies below the lens room; its ward is powered by the same rotating optical train.',
  escape:'Whiteouts can shelter flight, but rescue requires leaving the narrow dome and crossing unstable snow.',
