 stormbinder:'Channels lightning through marked copper paths and weather conductors, with a recharge interval. Grounding rods and indoor routes defeat some attacks.',
 fey_warlock:'Exploits contracts, names and limited guest-right wards. Deception works through exact terms, not universal coercion; carefully worded bargains can defeat them.',
 alchemist:'Deploys prototype mutagens, volatile stores and flawed constructs. Reagents are finite and collateral damage threatens the wizard’s valuable work.',
 oracle:'Plans from imperfect divinations and can anticipate likely approaches, not know every choice. Contradictory evidence and deliberate misdirection complicate predictions.',
 runekeeper:'Commands heavy guardians and localized seals. Runes require intact inscriptions and fixed locations; breaking or covering a link can isolate a chamber.'
};

